  "description": "Welcome to the Squirtle Squad, a vibrant community of adventurous and spirited Pokémon! Known for their mischievous antics and unbreakable camaraderie, our guild embraces teamwork, creativity, and a splash of fun. Whether you&#039;re here to hone your skills, tackle challenges, or simply enjoy the thrill of exploration, the Squirtle Squad is the place for you. Join us as we navigate the world with courage, share our love for water battles, and create unforgettable memories. Together, we’re more than just a guild—we&#039;re a family of Squirtles ready to make a splash!\n\n\n\n✅ Join Requirement\n\nPlay Active\n\nCombat lvl 35\n\n🚫 Kick Conditions\n\nMissing raids or not contributing the the challenges for 7 days in a row\n\n⏰Raid Schedule\n\nEVERY DAY - \n\nLevel 60 Raid - 3:00 PM EDT",
